{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ae754cab-ef11-8939-85c7-e79f573ed98b",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T14:40:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosemarie Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:36:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:36:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Good afternoon. Yes, I am calling about the drain, the catch basin, at the corner by my house. It is full of leaves and the water, it comes back into my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:36:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a clogged catch basin. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:36:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 149 Rhode Island Avenue. In the Historic Hill, you know. The drain is right at the corner, maybe ten steps from my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One forty-nine Rhode Island Avenue, got it. And this is from the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:36:52-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, the nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. The rain stopped yesterday, but the water, it is still sitting there. And it is not the first time, Kevin. Every time it rains hard, the same thing. The leaves just sit on top and nobody comes to clean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:37:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a pain. Let me write this down. Catch basin at the corner, leaves blocking the grate, water backing into the driveway. Did you get any water into the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:37:22-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, not in the house. Only the driveway, and up to the step. But I went out with my hands, I took the leaves off the grate myself. [pause] And it helped, for maybe ten minutes. Then more leaves come down with the water, and it is blocked again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:37:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, you got out there and did it by hand. That's more than most people would do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:37:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, somebody must do it, no? Because the city does not come. [pause] Hold still, please. Hold still, I am almost finished. Sorry, Kevin, I am doing my daughter's hair for school tomorrow, she is moving too much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:38:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, take your time. I've got the location. I'll send this over to the crew that does the drains. They're backed up after the storm, a lot of basins to get to, but I'll mark it as repeat trouble at that corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:38:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, mark it. Because it keeps happening, and I call, and then nothing, and then it rains again. I would like somebody to really come and clean it out. Not only look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:38:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Is this the best number to reach you? I've got a cell showing up here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:38:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is the cell. Four zero one, five five five, zero one eight five. And my name is Rosemarie Barone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:38:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rosemarie Barone, 401-555-0185. Is Barone B-A-R-O-N-E?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:38:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Two R in Rosemarie, no, one R, two... [pause] R-O-S-E-M-A-R-I-E. Just the one R. Sorry, my English, sometimes the letters, they go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:39:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're fine. I've got it. So I'll put the request in today, and when the crew's been out, we'll have somebody call you back to let you know it's done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:39:14-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is what I want, a call back when it is done. Please. Because if I do not hear, I will think it is still the same, and I will go out again with my hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:39:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. If it fills up again before they get there, you can call back and we'll add it to the ticket. Anything else going on over there, other drains, anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:39:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, only this one. This is the one that bothers me. The others on the street, they are okay, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Kevin, thank you. You are very kind to listen. Stay still, amor, one more minute. Thank you, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:39:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Rosemarie. Take care, bye now."
    }
  ],
